    metaTitle: "Evaluating Scorpion-Style Legal Marketing Services",
    excerpt: "How to evaluate full-service legal marketing offerings like Scorpion's alongside other available options.",
    metaDescription: "Full-service legal marketing offerings like Scorpion's bundle SEO, PPC, and website design together. This guide covers evaluating that model against alternatives.",
